{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>擁有 85 年歷史嘅美國人氣雪糕巨頭 Dairy Queen宣佈將於今年 11 月正式進駐香港！首間旗艦店選址銅鑼灣核心地段 One Causeway Bay，而觀塘分店亦已正式圍板，選址The ANGLE。Dairy Queen準備一口氣連開4間，港九新界朋友都飲得到！香港店當然帶來招牌產品 Blizzard®軟雪糕，也會陸續引進奶昔、芭菲、雪糕蛋糕等。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178843682012349634_7761885136a9961549ad34.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178843682216699485_9545499266a9961567d6e8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17884368237309805_3209251306a9961589a125.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178843682637163487_17333210806a99615ab7da2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T12:20:14.682395+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}